.TH LCD-SYSTEM-INFO-PUBLISHER 1 "2026-08-11" "GWAY local tools" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
lcd-system-info-publisher \- publish host status frames for the local LCD
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B lcd-system-info-publisher
.RI [ options ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B lcd-system-info-publisher
writes a compact script-channel rotation for
.BR lcd-lockfile-runner (1)
under
.IR /home/arthe/.local/state/lcd-lockfiles .
.PP
The current rotation omits routine summary, normal power, healthy services,
quiet logs, and TODO/work screens. Abnormal power, service, or log frames still
appear when there is something to inspect.
.PP
The standby rotation has four unlabeled frames: node identity, combined health,
log status, and the AP then Ethernet IPv4 addresses.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B --lock-dir DIR
Write lockfiles under
.IR DIR .
.TP
.B --dry-run
Print generated frames without writing lockfiles.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I /home/arthe/.local/state/lcd-lockfiles/lcd-rotation.script
Generated script-channel frames.
.TP
.I /home/arthe/.local/state/lcd-lockfiles/lcd-channels.lck
Active channel order. This publisher writes only
.BR script .
.TP
.I /home/arthe/.local/state/lcd-lockfiles/lcd-system-info.json
JSON copy of the generated frames.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR lcd-lockfile-runner (1)
